    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 13 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> None<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Cramped<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Empower</p><p>A relaxing space that helps align mind, body, and spirit.</p><p><strong>Empower: Inner Peace.</strong> Your hirelings use the chamber to find a measure of inner peace. The next time you roll for a Bastion event, you can roll twice and choose either result.</p><p><strong>Fortify Self.</strong> You can meditate here over 7 days. If you leave the Bastion during that time, you gain nothing; otherwise, at the end of the seventh day, you gain Advantage on two kinds of saving throws for the next 7 days, determined by rolling 1d6 twice (reroll duplicates): 1 Strength, 2 Dexterity, 3 Constitution, 4 Intelligence, 5 Wisdom, 6 Charisma.</p>",
